{
  "title": "02 - Create a recurring bulk action with comprehensive settings",
  "description": "Creates or replaces a recurring bulk action that runs on the first and the fifteenth of each month, with calendar filters, notifications, and tags. The initial 201 response creates a new resource and can already report Succeeded. The initial 200 response replaces an existing resource and shows Updating while schedule reconciliation is pending. Poll Azure-AsyncOperation for completion, then GET the resource; neither initial response means the scheduled virtual machine operations have run.",
  "operationId": "RecurringBulkActions_CreateOrUpdate",
  "parameters": {
    "api-version": "2026-11-06-preview",
    "subscriptionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "resourceGroupName": "example-rg",
    "scheduledActionName": "first-fifteenth-start",
    "resource": {
